IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. PROG-RVV-Q4-GEMV.

DATA DIVISION.
01 MATRIX-ROWS         PIC 9(9) USAGE R0.
01 MATRIX-COLS         PIC 9(9) USAGE R1.
01 VECTOR-LANES        PIC 9(9) USAGE R2.
01 SPEEDUP-X100        PIC 9(9) USAGE R3.

PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAIN-RVV-GEMV.
    IF MATRIX-ROWS == 0 OR MATRIX-COLS == 0
        GO TO ERROR-EXIT.
    END-IF.

    IF VECTOR-LANES == 0
        MOVE 16 TO VECTOR-LANES.
    END-IF.

    MOVE 250 TO SPEEDUP-X100.

    SET depth 3.
    WEIGHT 32 MATRIX-ROWS.
    WEIGHT 30 SPEEDUP-X100.
    EVAL.
    PRUNE 15.
    GO TO END-STRATEGY.

ERROR-EXIT.
    SET depth 0.
    EVAL.

END-STRATEGY.
